---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import FAQ from '../components/FAQ.astro';
import FAQPageSchema from '../components/FAQPageSchema.astro';
import LocalBusinessSchema from '../components/LocalBusinessSchema.astro';
import CTA from '../components/CTA.astro';

const city = "Rahway";
const latitude = 40.6127;
const longitude = -74.2858;

const faqs = [
  { q: "How far is AllStar from Rahway?", a: "About 8 minutes via Route 1. 1166 West Chestnut St, Union. Free parking on-site." },
  { q: "What programs are available?", a: "Adult BJJ, Muay Thai, and MMA (ages 16+). Kids Lions (7–13) and Cubs (4–6). Summer camp runs seasonally." },
  { q: "Do I need experience?", a: "No. Most students — adults and kids — start with none." },
  { q: "Can I watch a class before enrolling my child?", a: "Yes. Walk in any time. We don't hide what we do." },
  { q: "What's the free trial?", a: "Two weeks of unlimited classes. Adults can try any program. Kids can try their age group. No card required, no contract, no pressure." },
  { q: "How do I start?", a: "Fill out the form on this page or call (908) 341-1131. We'll text to confirm a class time." },
];
---

<PageLayout
  title="Martial Arts in Rahway, NJ — BJJ, Muay Thai & Kids Classes | AllStar"
  description="Martial arts classes for Rahway, NJ families at AllStar Martial Arts in Union. BJJ, Muay Thai, MMA, and Kids programs. Renzo Gracie black belt. Free 2-week trial."
  ogImage="/images/adult-bjj-hero.jpg"
>
  <Fragment slot="head">
    <LocalBusinessSchema city={city} latitude={latitude} longitude={longitude} />
    <FAQPageSchema faqs={faqs} />
  </Fragment>

  <PageHero
    eyebrow="8 minutes from Rahway"
    headline="Martial Arts in Rahway, NJ"
    sub="Brazilian Jiu-Jitsu, Muay Thai, MMA, and kids classes — eight minutes north on Route 1 to Union. Free 2-week trial, no contract."
    bgImage="/images/adult-bjj-hero.jpg"
  />

  <!-- Intro -->
  <section class="section-pad bg-white">
    <div class="container-page max-w-3xl">
      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-brand-gray leading-relaxed mb-6">
        For a Rahway family, AllStar is about as close as a real martial arts gym gets — eight minutes up Route 1 from the train station and the arts district to our mats at 1166 West Chestnut in Union. Free parking, no circling the block. If you're weighing us against options over in <a href="/clark/" class="text-brand-navy font-bold hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors">Clark</a> or <a href="/linden/" class="text-brand-navy font-bold hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors">Linden</a>, the short drive is the easy part of the decision.
      </p>
      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-brand-gray leading-relaxed">
        What actually brings people back is the coaching. Coach Jamal Patterson is a Renzo Gracie black belt, ADCC veteran, and former pro MMA fighter who competed in the IFL and Bellator. That competition background changes how technique gets taught — not just what to do, but why it works when someone is fighting back. Students who've trained here five and ten years will point to that difference on the mat.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- BJJ -->
  <section class="section-pad bg-brand-gray-light">
    <div class="container-page max-w-3xl">
      <div class="eyebrow">Brazilian Jiu-Jitsu</div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl text-brand-black mb-5">BJJ Classes Near Rahway, NJ</h2>
      <p class="text-brand-gray leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Brazilian Jiu-Jitsu is our flagship. Adults 16 and up, and beginners are the norm — most people who walk in have never rolled before. Curious what a first month looks like? Our <a href="/adult-bjj/" class="text-brand-navy font-bold hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors">adult BJJ page</a> lays it out.
      </p>
      <p class="text-brand-gray leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Yes, other schools in the area teach BJJ — a few even share our Renzo Gracie lineage. The separator is the coach. Jamal's resume (ADCC, IFL, Bellator, UWC champion) isn't wall decoration; it's baked into every detail he drills with the class.
      </p>
      <p class="text-brand-gray leading-relaxed">
        Evening classes at 6, 7, and 8 PM most weekdays, built around the NJ Transit commute and working adults hopping off the North Jersey Coast Line. Two weeks free. No contract.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Kids -->
  <section class="section-pad bg-white">
    <div class="container-page max-w-3xl">
      <div class="eyebrow">Kids Martial Arts</div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl text-brand-black mb-5">Kids Martial Arts Near Rahway, NJ</h2>
      <div class="space-y-5">
        <div class="bg-brand-gray-light p-6 rounded-lg border-l-4 border-brand-gold">
          <h3 class="text-xl text-brand-black mb-2">Cubs — Ages 4–6</h3>
          <p class="text-brand-gray text-sm leading-relaxed">Preschool-age energy with martial arts structure. Focus on coordination, listening, and confidence. Short activities, high engagement, constant positive reinforcement.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-brand-gray-light p-6 rounded-lg border-l-4 border-brand-navy">
          <h3 class="text-xl text-brand-black mb-2">Lions — Ages 7–13</h3>
          <p class="text-brand-gray text-sm leading-relaxed">Real Brazilian Jiu-Jitsu technique. Takedowns, escapes, positions. These kids are not doing karate katas — they're learning a system that works. Parents consistently report that the confidence carries into school.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="text-brand-gray leading-relaxed mt-5">
        Bully prevention is woven into how we coach, not tacked on as a slogan. Once a Rahway kid genuinely knows they can handle themselves, the whole dynamic with a bully shifts — usually without a single punch being thrown. See more on our <a href="/self-defense/" class="text-brand-navy font-bold hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors">self-defense page</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Muay Thai + MMA -->
  <section class="section-pad bg-brand-navy text-white">
    <div class="container-page max-w-4xl">
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow text-brand-gold">Muay Thai</div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl mb-4">Muay Thai Near Rahway, NJ</h2>
          <p class="text-white/90 leading-relaxed">
            This is the program almost nobody else in the area runs. Across Rahway, Linden, and the Union corridor, you won't find authentic Muay Thai taught alongside real BJJ the way we do it — actual pad work, actual clinch, actual conditioning. Beginners are welcome and expected.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow text-brand-gold">MMA</div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl mb-4">MMA Classes Near Rahway, NJ</h2>
          <p class="text-white/90 leading-relaxed">
            Our MMA program fuses BJJ, Muay Thai, and wrestling into one complete system, coached by Jamal Patterson — a pro fighter who has cornered UFC athletes from their amateur debut to the pros. Adults 16 and up.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Landmarks -->
  <section class="section-pad bg-white">
    <div class="container-page max-w-3xl">
      <div class="eyebrow">If you know Rahway</div>
      <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl text-brand-black mb-5">You Know These Spots — We're 8 Minutes Away</h2>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
        {["Downtown Rahway", "Rahway Train Station", "Route 1 South", "Rahway Public Library", "Rahway High School", "Irving Avenue", "Cherry Street area", "Merck headquarters corridor"].map((l) => (
          <span class="bg-brand-gray-light text-brand-gray px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-sm">📍 {l}</span>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <FAQ items={faqs} />

  <CTA
    headline="Two Weeks Free — Rahway Families Welcome"
    sub="Show up. Bring water. We'll handle the rest. No commitment, no pressure."
  />
</PageLayout>
